From 8f92d29eddd4069e70ba1b7e41143ca5c8a30a9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:24:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Apertus 2 format: a thinking token budget

policy.generation.thinking_token_budget caps a think frame, so that a reply always has room within
max_new_tokens. vLLM closes the frame at the budget. Its V1 runner, which Chonk uses, searches each
request's whole output in Python on every step, so a patch resumes that search where it ended.
